sequenceDiagram
    participant Saga
    participant IS as InventoryService
    participant PS as PaymentService
    participant LS as LogisticsService
    participant EB as EventBus

    Note over Saga: StockReservation Step
    Saga->>IS: StockReservation.Command
    IS-->>Saga: StockReserved.Event
    
    Note over Saga: Payment Step
    Saga->>PS: Payment.Command
    PS-->>Saga: PaymentSuccess.Event
    
    Note over Saga: Delivery Step
    Saga->>LS: Delivery.Command
    LS-->>Saga: DeliverySuccess.Event
    
    Note over Saga: Completion
    Saga->>EB: FulfillmentCompleted.Event

    Note over Saga: Compensations
    Note right of IS: StockRelease.Command
    Note right of PS: PaymentRefund.Command
